SUMMARY:Cowlitz County Noxious Weed Control Board Meetings (Cowlitz County)
LOCATION:<p>The Cowlitz County Noxious Weed Control Board will meet on the 2nd Wednesday of each month in 2026\, except there will be no meeting in March\, July\, and November.&nbsp\;</p><p>The meetings will be held at 6:00 PM in the first-floor conference room at the WSU Extension Office\, 304 Cowlitz Way\, Kelso\, WA &nbsp\;98626.&nbsp\;</p><p><em>This calendar event is recurring\; you may receive cancellations for the three meetings that won&apos\;t occur\, in addition to the initial calendar series.&nbsp\;</em></p><ul type="disc"><li>January 14 (6:oo PM Board Member Hearing\, 6:20 PM Weed List Hearing)</li><li>February 11&nbsp\;</li><li>March &ndash\; NO MEETING</li><li>April 8&nbsp\;</li><li>May 13</li><li>June 10</li><li>July &ndash\; NO MEETING</li><li>August 12</li><li>September 9</li><li>October 14</li><li>November &nbsp\;&ndash\; NO MEETING</li><li>December 9</li></ul><p><br></p> - 304 Cowlitz Way KELSO WA 98626
URL:/common/modules/iCalendar/iCalendar.aspx?feed=calendar&catID=33
END:VEVENT
